<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/clash-verge-rev/clash-verge-rev/releases/download/v2.5.8/Clash.Verge_2.5.8_x64_fixed_webview2-setup.exe">64位</a> | <a href="https://github.com/clash-verge-rev/clash-verge-rev/releases/download/v2.5.8/Clash.Verge_2.5.8_arm64_fixed_webview2-setup.exe">ARM64</a></li>
</ul>
