<ul>
<li><a href="https://github.com/clash-verge-rev/clash-verge-rev/releases/download/v2.5.5/Clash.Verge_2.5.5_amd64.deb">64位</a> | <a href="https://github.com/clash-verge-rev/clash-verge-rev/releases/download/v2.5.5/Clash.Verge_2.5.5_arm64.deb">ARM64</a> | <a href="https://github.com/clash-verge-rev/clash-verge-rev/releases/download/v2.5.5/Clash.Verge_2.5.5_armhf.deb">ARMv7</a></li>
